  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: Open gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: Attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: Make sure you have made all possible improvements to the improvement
      room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: To go back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: Defeat the boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: THIS OGRE IS HUGE!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: The altar is a point of healing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: Heal yourself through the altar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: Finally this was almost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: There is a door on the side of the altar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: Leave the room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: Other players?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: Interact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: We are players just like you, but we arrived earlier and we are
      ensuring that only those worthy of Holiday's legacy have the opportunity to
      acquire the first key to the secret EGG, you passed all the challenges we set
      up hours before your arrival, it shouldn't be long before other players arrive
      too, wait here with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: If you're here, why haven't you gotten the EGG yet?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: Only one person does the challenge per day. We've formed a queue,
      and you're number 47 in that queue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83
    m_Localized: Seriously? Oh shit, but wait... who was first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84
    m_Localized: "A player named \u201CParzival\u201D found the EGG a few days before,
      his name is on the competition leaderboard, didn\u2019t you see?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85
    m_Localized: "No\u2026 but what do we do now?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86
    m_Localized: We protect the final challenge room at all costs, IOI must be on
      their way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87
    m_Localized: Okay, I'll be ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88
    m_Localized: DEVELOPERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89
